  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian &amp; Stabilisation Operations Team (HSOT) Surge Deployments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Humanitarian &amp; Stabilisation Operations Team (HSOT) Surge Deployments is a component of Ebola Virus Disease Outbreaks #10, #11 and #12 in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC) - UK Response reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;2,257,449. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Infectious disease control.</narrative>
  </description>
